# Build output and dependencies. Everything else this repo needs is source.
node_modules/
website/dist/

# The context kit is this package's Phase 2 deliverable, and it has to be
# committed. It is re-included here because a global ignore on this machine
# excludes any directory called claude-context, to stop a real one (which holds
# identity, memory and client notes) from ever reaching a repo. That rule is
# right, and this directory is the exception it cannot know about: these are
# blank templates carrying interview prompts, not anybody's filled-in context.
#
# The negation names the directory rather than the files inside it. Git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so un-ignoring
# claude-context/**/*.md alone would silently do nothing.
!phase-2-introducing-yourself/claude-context/
